{"updated":"2026-11-18T09:25:37.979Z","text":"Good evening, sir. Over the last twenty-four hours, the story leading the world is this: Apec summit live: Xi and Putin start talks as Trump arrives in China. Elsewhere, venezuelan boxer Linares arrested in US and faces deportation, ICE confirms. And ‘We want to go back’: Rohingya refugees pin hopes on ICJ genocide verdict. All of which keeps the conflict picture centred on US, at active conflict levels, though Ukraine, and Iran are worth keeping an eye on as well. The markets, for their part, felt the weight of it — the S&P 500 down 4.2 percent, the Dow Jones Industrial down 2.4 percent, and the Nasdaq Composite down 6.9 percent. The earth itself has been busier, with 51 tremors above magnitude two and a half — the strongest a 5.9 near 85 km WNW of San Juan, Peru. And overhead, space weather is calm — nothing of concern. That is the shape of the day, sir. The board is yours.","times":[0,0.12,0.17,0.22,0.26,0.3,0.36,0.41,0.44,0.49,0.53,0.56,0.59,0.63,0.65,0.7,0.82,0.92,1.07,1.39,1.51,1.56,1.58,1.6,1.65,1.67,1.7,1.72,1.78,1.82,1.9,1.97,2.02,2.06,2.09,2.14,2.18,2.21,2.26,2.31,2.36,2.39,2.44,2.48,2.53,2.58,2.62,2.68,2.75,2.82,2.94,3.03,3.12,3.16,3.19,3.23,3.27,3.32,3.39,3.48,3.56,3.62,3.7,3.75,3.81,3.85,3.9,3.95,3.97,4,4.05,4.08,4.1,4.12,4.17,4.21,4.3,4.35,4.42,4.5,4.56,4.68,4.71,4.77,4.79,4.85,4.97,5.12,5.29,5.8,5.98,6.06,6.18,6.25,6.3,6.35,6.4,6.44,6.49,6.56,6.59,6.68,6.73,6.91,6.97,7.09,7.13,7.25,7.33,7.5,7.58,7.62,7.66,7.7,7.77,7.81,7.94,8.02,8.1,8.17,8.27,8.34,8.41,8.47,8.53,8.6,8.66,8.71,8.82,8.88,8.96,9.06,9.11,9.21,9.25,9.31,9.36,9.42,9.46,9.52,9.58,9.63,9.66,9.72,9.76,9.86,9.9,9.95,9.97,10.02,10.05,10.1,10.17,10.21,10.28,10.37,10.45,10.6,10.77,11.16,11.27,11.33,11.38,11.44,11.47,11.53,11.57,11.63,11.76,11.79,11.89,11.96,12.03,12.07,12.14,12.21,12.28,12.4,12.46,12.52,12.55,12.61,12.65,12.77,12.89,12.93,12.96,13,13.04,13.11,13.18,13.33,13.4,13.49,13.56,13.63,13.72,13.77,13.82,13.88,13.96,14.03,14.11,14.13,14.19,14.21